[391.578221, "o", "Gold price sheet - checking row structure:\r\nRow 1: None, Gold, Fixing Committee of the London Bullion Market Association, London 3 PM fixed price, US$ per troy ounce\r\nRow 2: 1990M1, 409.819061279297\r\nRow 3: 1990M2, 417.181060791016\r\nRow 4: 1990M3, 392.703338623047\r\nRow 5: 1990M4, 374.292114257813\r\n"]
[391.578274, "o", "Row 6: 1990M5, 369.197631835938\r\n\r\nAnswer sheet rows 3-6:\r\nRow 3: B=Z-score (95% one-sided), C=1.645\r\nRow 4: B=3-month volatility, C=='Gold price'!D430\r\nRow 5: B=3-month volatility annualized, C==C4*SQRT(12)\r\nRow 6: B=12-month volatility, C=='Gold price'!E430\r\n\r\nCurrent formulas look correct.\r\nLet me verify the Gold price formulas are working...\r\n\r\nGold price row 430 (2025M9):\r\n  A: 2025M9\r\n  B: 3666.523636363636\r\n  C: =LN(B430/B429)*100\r\n  D: =STDEV(C428:C430)\r\n"]
[391.578302, "o", "  E: =STDEV(C419:C430)\r\n"]
