[483.061197, "o", "FINAL FORMULA VERIFICATION:\r\n\r\nGold price row 430 (2025M9):\r\n  C430 (log return): =LN(B430/B429)*100\r\n  D430 (3-mo vol): =STDEV(C428:C430)\r\n  E430 (12-mo vol): =STDEV(C419:C430)\r\n\r\n"]
[483.062836, "o", "Answer sheet Step 1:\r\n  C3 (Z-score): 1.645\r\n  C4 (3-mo vol): ='Gold price'!D430\r\n  C5 (3-mo ann): =C4*SQRT(12)\r\n  C6 (12-mo vol): ='Gold price'!E430\r\n\r\nAnswer sheet Step 2 exposure (row 13):\r\n  C13: =C12*$C$3*$C$5/100\r\n  D13: =D12*$C$3*$C$5/100\r\n  E13: =E12*$C$3*$C$5/100\r\n\r\nAnswer sheet Step 3:\r\n  C22 (exposure): =C21*$C$3*$C$5/100\r\n  C23 (total res): =XLOOKUP(\"*\"&C20&\"*\",'Total Reserves'!$C$1:$P$1,'Total Reserves'!$C$18:$P$18,,2)\r\n  C24 (RaR): =C22/C23*100\r\n\r\nAll formulas verified!\r\n"]
[483.101152, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@3f6fb1e5dcce:~/data# "]
